its. This coincidence does not equate independently documented recipes and sample states. Source-version limits, condition gaps and sample states are preserved. Evidence upgrades and legacy completions are zero. Only factual data, concise provenance, necessary tests and validation outputs are public; fulltexts, supplements and private paths stay local.",
